WEBVTT

00:00:14.995 --> 00:00:17.835
Welcome to San Francisco,
Mr. Wachowski.

00:00:18.894 --> 00:00:20.555
Are you enjoying
the clam chowder?

00:00:20.935 --> 00:00:23.235
It's the government wack job
who keeps trying to kill us.

00:00:23.775 --> 00:00:24.775
Unsuccessfully!

00:00:24.854 --> 00:00:26.675
Nice of you to swing by
on your way to Comic-Con.

00:00:26.935 --> 00:00:27.995
Yeah,
what are you wearing?

00:00:29.855 --> 00:00:30.935
It's a flight suit,

00:00:31.574 --> 00:00:34.354
designed to modulate
my body temperature
and reduce drag.

00:00:34.455 --> 00:00:35.895
Yeah, and yet
you still are one.

00:00:36.055 --> 00:00:37.735
Ooh-hoo! Good one.

00:00:37.995 --> 00:00:39.795
You are catching fire,
Thomas.

00:00:40.175 --> 00:00:42.694
Oh, and speaking of heat,
I see you've taken a lover.

00:00:42.694 --> 00:00:43.934
Does she have a name

00:00:44.055 --> 00:00:46.635
or should we just call her
"collateral damage"?

00:00:46.894 --> 00:00:48.015
[Tom] Hey, watch your mouth.

00:00:48.474 --> 00:00:50.175
Unless you want a little more
of what I gave you earlier?

00:00:50.774 --> 00:00:51.774
I punched him
in the face.

00:00:51.774 --> 00:00:54.354
Oh! He punched him
right in the face!
It was awesome!

00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:57.194
The time for talking is over!
It's time to push buttons.

00:00:57.455 --> 00:01:00.274
Your flying eggs are pretty
impressive, Mr. Eggman,

00:01:00.434 --> 00:01:02.995
but let's face it,
you'll never catch me.

00:01:03.574 --> 00:01:04.574
Confidence!

00:01:04.915 --> 00:01:06.835
A fool's substitute
for intelligence.

00:01:08.551 --> 00:01:12.367
[machine powering up]

00:01:14.644 --> 00:01:15.864
That's not good.
Uh...

00:01:17.344 --> 00:01:19.404
Sonic, I know you got
the super-speed
and everything,

00:01:19.405 --> 00:01:22.165
but Maddie and I...
Totally defenseless?
Probably gonna get blown up?

00:01:22.165 --> 00:01:23.165
Pretty much, yeah.

00:01:24.205 --> 00:01:26.764
Don't worry.
I know exactly what to do.

00:01:29.318 --> 00:01:31.274
[both screaming]

00:01:32.534 --> 00:01:33.794
[exhales]

00:01:33.894 --> 00:01:35.574
I was not expecting that.

00:01:36.455 --> 00:01:39.394
But I was expecting
not to expect something,
so it doesn't count.

00:01:43.052 --> 00:01:45.761
["Catch Me I'm Falling"
by Kelly Finnigan plays]

00:02:00.711 --> 00:02:02.751
[plays percussive melody]

00:02:13.832 --> 00:02:16.188
[buzzes]
[crackling]

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:24.525
Pew, pew-pew-pew,
pew-pew-pew-pew!

00:02:25.546 --> 00:02:26.705
[charging]

00:02:28.429 --> 00:02:31.666
[Sonic gasps]
Oh! [yells]

00:02:34.057 --> 00:02:35.781
[faint screaming]

00:02:35.886 --> 00:02:37.892
[groans, yells]

00:02:37.997 --> 00:02:39.334
[both screaming]

00:02:40.355 --> 00:02:41.355
[grunts] Come on!

00:02:41.953 --> 00:02:43.517
Come on, come on, come on.

00:02:43.616 --> 00:02:44.914
[both screaming]

00:02:45.713 --> 00:02:46.911
[grunts]

00:02:54.164 --> 00:02:55.164
[soft thump]

00:02:55.195 --> 00:02:57.658
Whoa, whoa, whoa!
No, no, no!

00:02:57.758 --> 00:03:00.320
[grunting]

00:03:01.085 --> 00:03:03.481
[rings clattering]

00:03:03.847 --> 00:03:05.345
[groans]

00:03:07.673 --> 00:03:08.904
[exhales]

00:03:09.005 --> 00:03:10.784
Oh! Hi, Tom.

00:03:11.184 --> 00:03:13.564
Glad you're here.
Could use some help.

00:03:13.644 --> 00:03:15.224
Old Bessie's
about to give birth.
[sighs]

00:03:16.345 --> 00:03:17.345
[cow moos]
Give me a minute.

00:03:17.834 --> 00:03:19.197
Aah.

00:03:20.245 --> 00:03:23.245
Can I give you one
genius piece of advice?

00:03:24.324 --> 00:03:25.324
Don't run.

00:03:25.765 --> 00:03:27.525
It'll only hurt more if you do.

00:03:28.365 --> 00:03:30.525
And it's bad for your joints.
They've proved it.

00:03:30.945 --> 00:03:32.765
All right, Eggman.
You wanna get fast?

00:03:33.205 --> 00:03:34.265
Let's get fast.

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:36.420
[rings jingling]

00:03:37.245 --> 00:03:38.904
The hard way it is.

00:03:39.008 --> 00:03:40.847
[turbines humming]

00:03:42.826 --> 00:03:43.936
[horns blaring]

00:03:44.041 --> 00:03:45.603
[panting]

00:03:56.918 --> 00:03:57.918
[loud grunt]

00:03:57.995 --> 00:03:59.815
That was an illegal left,
by the way.

00:04:02.855 --> 00:04:04.495
[Sonic] So, here we are again.

00:04:04.815 --> 00:04:06.194
We've been through
so much together.

00:04:06.614 --> 00:04:09.194
Now you understand why there's
a psychotic robot doctor

00:04:09.194 --> 00:04:11.315
chasing a supersonic
blue hedgehog.

00:04:11.635 --> 00:04:13.915
Want to know how it ends?
Yeah, me too.

00:04:31.645 --> 00:04:32.865
How is this possible?

00:04:33.265 --> 00:04:34.725
No one's ever
caught up to me before.

00:04:41.483 --> 00:04:43.280
[gasps]

00:04:43.398 --> 00:04:45.390
Coming through!

00:04:45.508 --> 00:04:46.719
Sacrebleu!

00:04:47.735 --> 00:04:48.735
Excusez-moi, monsieur!
[cackles]

00:04:52.945 --> 00:04:55.545
Here we go.
Room to open it up.

00:04:57.899 --> 00:04:59.141
[grunts]

00:05:04.645 --> 00:05:05.705
I can't lose him!

00:05:12.854 --> 00:05:14.880
[lasers firing]

00:05:20.394 --> 00:05:22.995
If you can't beat 'em,
blind 'em.

00:05:25.995 --> 00:05:27.814
Lost visual contact.

00:05:33.045 --> 00:05:36.845
You're not allowed up there!
It's one of the Seven Wonders!

00:05:39.712 --> 00:05:41.706
[charging]

00:05:41.810 --> 00:05:43.559
[panting]

00:05:44.957 --> 00:05:46.041
[beeping]

00:05:46.147 --> 00:05:47.335
[yells]

00:05:49.713 --> 00:05:52.476
[people exclaiming]

00:05:54.084 --> 00:05:55.623
[coins jingle]

00:05:57.022 --> 00:05:59.190
[engine rumbling]

00:06:01.428 --> 00:06:03.072
[woman] Get out of here!

00:06:06.953 --> 00:06:08.841
[Robotnik cackles]

00:06:10.905 --> 00:06:13.725
You're an astonishing
little creature.

00:06:16.145 --> 00:06:18.604
It'll be fun to take you
back to the lab

00:06:18.604 --> 00:06:20.784
for a litany of invasive
exploratory procedures.

00:06:21.944 --> 00:06:23.184
Any last words?

00:06:24.544 --> 00:06:27.124
Guac. I like that word.

00:06:28.665 --> 00:06:31.374
I don't have to tell you how
many scientific breakthroughs

00:06:31.374 --> 00:06:33.205
have been made possible
by animal testing.

00:06:33.485 --> 00:06:34.685
You're being very selfish.

00:06:35.184 --> 00:06:36.184
Going my way?

00:06:36.184 --> 00:06:37.184
What the-- [grunts]

00:06:37.215 --> 00:06:38.319
[engines whirring]

00:06:38.422 --> 00:06:40.595
[both grunting]

00:06:42.445 --> 00:06:44.525
Who the hell
do you think you are?

00:06:45.036 --> 00:06:46.614
[loud groan]

00:06:48.074 --> 00:06:49.694
I'm the Donut Lord,
you son of a--

00:06:49.799 --> 00:06:51.157
[yells]

00:06:53.385 --> 00:06:54.779
[grunts]

00:06:54.884 --> 00:06:56.124
Autopilot, adjust.

00:06:57.064 --> 00:06:58.064
Why?

00:06:58.384 --> 00:07:01.604
Why would you throw
your life away for this thing?

00:07:02.004 --> 00:07:03.304
That's why I don't have friends.

00:07:03.745 --> 00:07:05.765
Next thing you know,
you're somebody's best man.

00:07:05.804 --> 00:07:07.065
They want to have
the wedding out of town.

00:07:07.065 --> 00:07:09.084
Like nobody has anything
better to do!

00:07:09.865 --> 00:07:11.605
Anyway, where were we?
[groans]

00:07:11.985 --> 00:07:14.745
Oh, yes.
You were about to die.

00:07:15.301 --> 00:07:16.713
[gunshot ricochets]

00:07:16.824 --> 00:07:18.784
That's our sheriff
you're messing with.

00:07:20.424 --> 00:07:22.064
And our blue devil...
[chain saw revs]

00:07:22.064 --> 00:07:25.404
who as everyone can see
is a very real creature,

00:07:25.404 --> 00:07:28.144
and not at all invented by me.

00:07:29.357 --> 00:07:30.533
[chain saw idles]

00:07:30.644 --> 00:07:32.745
Oh, careful.
Just-- Just put it away.

00:07:32.745 --> 00:07:33.745
Tom?

